          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.07,
          "end": 45.873,
          "en": "because this will be done for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.71,
          "end": 49.26,
          "en": "And once you've got everything set up,",
